          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਪਹੇਲੀ (pahelī) is inherited from Sanskrit prahelikā, \"riddle\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi parhelī, \"riddle\", and pahelī under it (CDIAL 8911)."
